      "width": 280,
      "height": 145,
      "text": "\u2514\u2500 PK id: UUID\n\u2514\u2500 FK firmware_id: UUID\n\u2514\u2500 FK device_id: UUID\n\u2514\u2500 status: ENUM (10 states)\n\u2514\u2500 retry_count: INT\n\u2514\u2500 error_message: TEXT\n\u2514\u2500 created_at: DATETIME\n\u2514\u2500 updated_at: DATETIME",
