    {
      "id": "api-device-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 150,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "Device Router (prefix: /devices)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "api-device-endpoints",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "POST /register\n  Body: {name, firmware_version, ip_address}\n\u2192 201: {device_id, name, status}\n  Notes: Auto-registers or re-activates\n\nPOST /{id}/heartbeat\n  Body: {uptime_percentage, signal_strength}\n\u2192 200: {status: \"ok\", last_seen}\n\nGET /\n  Query: ?status=online|offline\n\u2192 200: {devices: [...], total: N}",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "api-ota-router",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 180,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "api-ota-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 130,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "OTA Router (prefix: /ota)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "api-ota-endpoints",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 415,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "POST /upload\n  Form: version + file (binary)\n\u2192 200: {id, version, sha256_hash, file_size}\n  Action: Saves binary, computes SHA256\n\nPOST /trigger\n  Body: {firmware_id, device_ids|all_devices}\n\u2192 200: {deployment_ids: [...], message}\n  Action: Publishes MQTT command per device\n\nGET /status\n\u2192 200: {deployments: [...], counts}\n\nGET /firmware\n\u2192 200: [{id, version, sha256_hash, ...}]",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "api-agents-router",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 95,
      "strokeColor": "#0b7285",
      "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "api-agents-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 758,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "Agents Router (prefix: /agents) [NEW]",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#0b7285",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "api-agents-endpoints",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 785,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 55,
      "text": "GET /recommendations \u2192 All 3 agents (OTA plan + anomaly check + device groups)\nGET /ota-campaign?fw=2.0.0 \u2192 Canary-based rollout plan with phases + gates\nGET /anomaly-check?notify=false \u2192 Fleet health scan: weak signal, stuck OTAs, failure spikes\nGET /device-groups?min=3 \u2192 Groupings by firmware version + signal strength buckets",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "api-dash-router",
      "type": "rectangle",
