    {
      "id": "mqtt-tree-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 715,
      "width": 630,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "iot/fleet/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 register                          \u2190 Device publishes on first connect\n\u2502   Payload: {name, firmware_version, ip_address}\n\u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 {device_id}/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 heartbeat                     \u2190 Device publishes every 10s\n\u2502   \u2502   Payload: {uptime_percentage, signal_strength}\n\u2502   \u2502\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 command/\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 ota                       \u2190 Backend publishes OTA instruction\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2502   Payload: {firmware_url, sha256_hash, timestamp}\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 config                    \u2190 Backend pushes remote config\n\u2502   \u2502       Payload: {config: {...}, timestamp}\n\u2502   \u2502\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 status/\n\u2502       \u2514\u2500\u2500 ota                       \u2190 Device reports OTA lifecycle\n\u2502           Payload: {status, deployment_id, device_id, timestamp, error?}\n\u2502           States: downloading \u2192 applying \u2192 verifying \u2192 success | hash_mismatch \u2192 rollback \u2192 rolled_back",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "mqtt-qos",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 970,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "All topic subscriptions and publications use QoS 1 (at-least-once delivery). The backend subscribes to iot/fleet/+/status/ota, iot/fleet/+/heartbeat, and iot/fleet/register on connect.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
