    },
    {
      "id": "metrics-gauges",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1660,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 155,
      "text": "Gauges (current values):\n  fleet_active_devices        \u2014 online device count\n  fleet_total_devices          \u2014 total registered count\n  fleet_ota_in_progress        \u2014 active OTA deployments\n\nCounters (cumulative):\n  fleet_ota_deployments_total{status} \u2014 per-status OTA count\n  fleet_mqtt_messages_published_total \u2014 MQTT out\n  fleet_mqtt_messages_received_total  \u2014 MQTT in\n\nHistogram:\n  fleet_api_request_latency_seconds{method,endpoint}\n    Buckets: 5ms, 10ms, 25ms, 50ms, 100ms, 250ms, 500ms, 1s, 2.5s, 5s, +Inf",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "metrics-prom",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 1660,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 155,
      "text": "Prometheus scrape config:\n  Job: fleet-commander\n  Target: backend:8000/metrics/\n  Interval: 10s\n\nGrafana dashboard panels:\n  \u2022 Active Devices (stat)\n  \u2022 Total Devices (stat)\n  \u2022 OTA In Progress (stat)\n  \u2022 OTA Success Rate (stat %)\n  \u2022 API Latency P95 (graph)\n  \u2022 OTA Deployments by Status (pie)\n  \u2022 MQTT Throughput (graph)\n  \u2022 Device Uptime (bar gauge)\n\nAll panels auto-refresh from Prometheus.",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "section9-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1870,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "9. Agent Architecture (Phase 1 \u2014 Assisted Mode) [NEW]",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-layout-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1915,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 430,
      "strokeColor": "#0b7285",
      "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-layout-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1925,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "9a. Agent Layer \u2014 Dual Execution Mode",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#0b7285",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-mode-inbackend",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1955,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Mode 1: In-Backend (default when running via API)\n  Dashboard UI \u2192 GET /agents/* \u2192 agents/routers.py\n  \u2192 agents/async_tools.py (SQLAlchemy direct DB)\n  \u2192 Structured response \u2192 Dashboard panels\n  Advantages: No self-referencing HTTP, no deadlock,\n              single-worker safe",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-mode-cli",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 390,
      "y": 1955,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Mode 2: Standalone CLI (run_agents.py)\n  CLI \u2192 agents/phase1_crew.py \u2192 agents/tools.py\n  \u2192 HTTP requests to Fleet Commander API\n  \u2192 Structured output \u2192 Console / JSON\n  Advantages: Works outside Docker, usable from\n              any machine with network access",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-three-crews",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2090,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "9b. Three Phase 1 Agent Crews\n\nCrew 1: OTA Campaign Strategist\n  Input: firmware + device list\n  Output: canary group (10%), 3 rollout phases (30/60/100%), gates, risk assessment\n  Heuristics: canary_size = max(1, len(devices)//10); phases with pass/fail gates\n  Endpoint: GET /agents/ota-campaign?firmware_version=X.X.X\n\nCrew 2: Fleet Health Monitor (Anomaly Detection)\n  Input: device list + OTA status\n  Output: anomalies grouped by severity (critical/warning)\n  Checks: weak signal < -90dBm, stuck OTAs, failure rate > 30%, >30% offline\n  Notifications: Slack via SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL env var\n  Endpoint: GET /agents/anomaly-check?notify=true\n\nCrew 3: Device Group Manager\n  Input: device list\n  Output: groups by firmware version + signal strength buckets\n  Groups: Firmware Cohorts, Signal: Good/Moderate/Poor\n  Endpoint: GET /agents/device-groups?min_group_size=3",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-files-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 1870,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 300,
      "strokeColor": "#0b7285",
      "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-files-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 1880,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "9c. Agent File Structure",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#0b7285",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-files-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 1915,
      "width": 630,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "fleet-management/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 agents/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 __init__.py          # Package init\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 tools.py             # HTTP tools (CLI mode)\n\u2502   \u2502                      # Requires FLEET_BACKEND_URL\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 async_tools.py       # Async DB tools (in-backend)\n\u2502   \u2502                      # Uses SQLAlchemy + get_db()\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 phase1_crew.py      # Crew AI agent definitions\n\u2502   \u2502                      # + heuristic fallback functions\n\u2502   \u2502                      # Optional LLM mode: CREWAI_ENABLED=1\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 routers.py          # FastAPI router: /agents/*\n\u2502                              # 4 endpoints consuming async_tools\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 run_agents.py         # CLI entry point\n\u2502   Usage: python run_agents.py --ota\n\u2502          python run_agents.py --anomaly --no-notify\n\u2502          python run_agents.py --json | jq .\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 Dockerfile\n     \u2514\u2500 gcc g++ installed (optional crewai support)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-endpoints-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 2190,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 180,
      "strokeColor": "#0b7285",
      "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-endpoints-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "9d. Agent API Endpoints Summary",
