      "y": 2230,
      "width": 630,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "GET /agents/recommendations\n  Runs all 3 agents, returns combined results\n  Query: ?notify=false&firmware_version=X.X.X&min_group_size=3\n\nGET /agents/ota-campaign?firmware_version=X.X.X\n  Returns: canary group, rollout phases, risk assessment, recommendation\n  human_input_required: true\n\nGET /agents/anomaly-check?notify=true\n  Returns: healthy | anomalies_found, anomalies[] with severity\n  Notifications: Slack webhook for critical/warning\n\nGET /agents/device-groups?min_group_size=3\n  Returns: groups[] with name, dimension, count, rationale\n  human_input_required: true",
